<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Hardscaping — Chief Cornerstone</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<section class="service-hero" style="background-image:url('/images/service-hardscape.jpg')">
  <div class="service-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container service-hero-content">
    <div class="service-hero-tag">Our Services</div>
    <h1>Hardscaping</h1>
    <p>Patios, walkways, and outdoor living spaces built to last a lifetime.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-page-grid">
      <div class="service-page-content">
        <h2>Build Something That Lasts</h2>
        <p>Hardscaping adds structure, function, and real value to your property. A well-built patio, walkway, or retaining wall doesn't just look good — it changes how you live in your outdoor space.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">We build with quality materials, proper drainage, and the craftsmanship that ensures your investment holds up through Texas summers, freeze events, and everything in between.</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:16px">What We Build</h3>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Patios — concrete, pavers, flagstone</li>
          <li>Walkways and garden paths</li>
          <li>Retaining walls and terracing</li>
          <li>Outdoor kitchens and fire pit areas</li>
          <li>Decorative stone, gravel, and mulch beds</li>
          <li>Steps and entryway enhancements</li>
          <li>Drainage solutions</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="scripture" style="margin-top:36px">
          <span>"Therefore everyone who hears these words of mine and puts them into practice is like a wise man who built his house on the rock."</span>
          <cite>— Matthew 7:24</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-page-sidebar">
        <div class="service-sidebar-card">
          <h4>Ready to Get Started?</h4>
          <p>Contact us for a free consultation. We'll assess your space and show you what's possible.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:16px">Request a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-sidebar-card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0">
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/lawn-maintenance" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Lawn Maintenance</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/landscape-design" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Landscape Design</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/tree-trimming" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Tree & Shrub Trimming</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/irrigation" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Irrigation Systems</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0"><a href="/services/seasonal-cleanup" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Seasonal Cleanup</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-cta">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <h2>Ready to Transform Your Outdoor Space?</h2>
    <p>Free estimate — let's talk about what you want to build.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold" style="margin-top:28px">Request a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
